Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.19,0:01:35.78,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,LOVE UNSEEN BENEATH THE CLEAR NIGHT SKY
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.91,0:09:55.29,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,ASOSIASI MEDIS SEIROUKAI
